  "sol": "*****************\n* CRITICAL TASK *\n*****************\n\nB737 AMM 72-00-00\nSUBTASK 72-00-00-210-022-F00, Par. 5.H.4\n\nRe-install/ Re-tighten the inner plug and outer plugs for port S8.\n\nRecord:\n1. The inner plug - Initial Torque\n\n   |===+======+===================+===============|\n   |No | Port | Limitation Torque | Actual Torque |\n   |   |      |      (lb.in)      |    (lb.in)    |\n   |===+======+===================+===============|\n   | 1.|  S8  |       76 - 84     |               |\n   |===+======+===================+===============|\n\n2. Loosen the inner plug by one-quarter turn.\n\n3. Tighten the inner plug again to run on torque plus 15-20 lb.in)\n\n4. The outer plug\n\n   |===+======+===================+===============|\n   |No | Port | Limitation Torque | Actual Torque |\n   |   |      |      (lb.in)      |    (lb.in)    |\n   |===+======+===================+===============|\n   | 1.|  S8  |       57 - 63     |               |\n   |===+======+===================+===============|\n\nIMTE Used No : ________________"
