  "sol": "1. SUBTASK 72-00-21-420-057\nParagraph 3.Q.2 thru 3.Q.3\n\nRe-torque loose screw on fan strut panel No. 3, 5, 8, 10, and 11\n\nParagraph 3.Q.2\nActual torque: __________________ lb in.\nLimitation: 60-65 lb in.\nIMTE No.: __________________\n\nParagraph 3.Q.3\nActual torque: __________________ lb in.\nLimitation: 60-65 lb in.\nIMTE No.: __________________\n\nNOTE: Continue with the next step if re-torque has not been done successfully\n\n2. SUBTASK 72-00-21-040-053\nParagraph 3.H.1 thru 3.H.3\n\nRemove fan strut panel No. 3, 5, 8, 10, and 11 as necessary\n\n3. Misc. Repair\n\nPerform replacement of key locked inserts refer to SPM 70-42-13\n\nNOTE: Skip this task if key locked inserts replacement is not necessary (Strut panels need to be replaced).\n\n4. Misc. Repair\n\nPerform replacement of riveted nut refer to SPM 70-43-11\n\nNOTE: Skip this task if riveted nut replacement is not necessary (Strut panels need to be replaced).\n\n5. SUBTASK 72-00-21-420-057\nParagraph 3.Q.1 thru 3.Q.4\n\nInstall fan strut panel No. 3, 5, 8, 10, and 11\n\nParagraph 3.Q.2\nActual torque: __________________ lb in.\nLimitation: 60-65 lb in.\nIMTE No.: __________________\n\nParagraph 3.Q.3\nActual torque: __________________ lb in.\nLimitation: 60-65 lb in.\nIMTE No.: __________________"
