  "sol": "1. Engineering Information\n\nBroken flanged bushing finding on HPC Actuating Ring rectification refer to the following condition:\n1. Flanged bushing on Actuation Ring IGV and Stage 3 are permitted per ESM 72-00-00, Special Procedure 110 inspection workscope\n2. Flanged bushing on Actuation Ring Stage 2 is rectified iaw.\nCore Major Module NRT jobcard order 512204120\n\n2.Visual Inspection\nSUBTASK 72-00-00-220-074\nParagraph 3.A\n\nDo a General Visual Inspection (GVI) of Flanged Bushing on Actuation Ring Stage 1.\n\nLimitation per AMM 72-32-00: Up to three missing bushings for each stage permitted. Missing or broken bushing legs bushing legs are permitted.\n\nInspection Result:\n__________________________________________________________\n__________________________________________________________\n__________________________________________ Accept / Reject\n\nNOTE: If the inspection results exceed the serviceable limits defined above, proceed to the next operation as specified in the job card. If the condition remains within limits, no rectification is required and the following operation may be disregarded.\n\n3. AMM TASK 72-32-00-900-801-F00\nParagraph 2.F.\n\nReplace missing Actuation Ring Flanged Bushing Stage 1."
