  "order": "805707274",
  "engine": "CFM56-7",
  "task": "DURING REMOVA STRUT FAIRING 3 O'CLOCK FOUND 2 EA SCREW STUCK",
  "sol": "1. SUBTASK 72-00-00-020-411\nParagraph 3.A.3.f\n\nRemove screws remove Strut 4 fairing\n\nNOTE: Stuck screws will be removed by drilling on the next operation. Proceed to the next step.\n\n2. SUBTASK 72-00-00-020-411\nParagraph 3.A.3.1 & 3.A.3.k\n\n- Remove bolts ([75-360]) which attach harness support ([75-370]) to harness support ([75-400]).\n- Remove bolts ([75-380]) which attach harness support ([75-400]) to the strut plate. Remove harness supports ([75-370]), ([75-400]).\n\n3. Miscellaneous Repair\n\nRemove stuck screw on strut fairing No. 4 refer to TASK 70-41-14\n\n4. Miscellaneous Repair\n\nReplace defective floating lug self-locking nut refer to SPM TASK 70-43-11\n\n5. SUBTASK 72-00-00-420-386\nParagraph 3.F.6 thru 3.F.10\n\n- Attach the two harness supports ([75-370], [75-400]) together with bolts ([75-360])\n- Attach harness support ([75-400]) to the strut base with bolts ([75-380]).\n\nParagraph 3.F.10\nActual bolt [75-360] torque: __________________ lb in.\nActual bolt [75-380] torque: __________________ lb in.\nLimitation: 110-120 lb in.\nIMTE No.: __________________"
