  "sol": "1. Assembly\n\nInstall Clamp (285) on hydraulic hose.\n\nRefer to PPBM 71-00-02 figure 21-1, sheet 10\n\nRecord the following torque values:\n===============================================================\n|Figure 21-1|    Tighten    | Limit   |Act. Torque|   IMTE    |\n| Sheet No. |    item No.   |(lb in.) |  (lb in.) |    No.    |\n---------------------------------------------------------------\n|     10    |       275     |  78-82  |           |           |\n|           |-------------------------------------------------|\n|           |       280     |  78-82  |           |           |\n|-------------------------------------------------------------|\n\n2. INSTALL THE FUEL SUPPLY HOSE\nRefer to PPBM 71-00-02 figure 12-1, sheet 1 to 2\n\nRecord the following torque values :\n|===========+===============+=========+===========+===========|\n|Figure 12-1|    Tighten    | Limit   |Act. Torque|   IMTE    |\n| Sheet No. |    item No.   |(lb in.) |  (lb in.) |    No.    |\n|-----------+---------------+---------+-----------+-----------|\n|     1     |       15      |  50-55  |           |           |\n|-----------+---------------+---------+-----------+-----------|\n|     2     |       55      |  98-110 |           |           |\n|===========+===============+=========+===========+===========|"
