  "sol": "1. GENERAL PRECAUTION\n\n- OBEY WARNING, CAUTION, AND NOTE THAT STATED IN APPROVED MAINTENANCE MANUAL.\n- ENSURE PART AND AREA ARE CLEAR OF FOREIGN OBJECT DAMAGE (FOD).\n- READ THE GENERAL INSTRUCTION BEFORE START REFER TO PARAGRAPH 1.\n- PREPARE TOOLS, EQUIPMENT, AND MATERIALS REFER TO PARAGRAPH 2.\n\nReference:\nB737 AMM REV.88 15-OCT-25  DOC. NO. D633A101­BER\n\n2. TASK 79-21-06-000-801\nAMM B737-600/700/800/900\n\nPARAGRAPH 2.F.1 THRU 2.F.3\n\nRemove the Filter Element.\n\n3. TASK 79-00-00-810-003-F00\nParagraph 3.E.3\n\nReset the Pop-out Indicator\n\n4. TASK 79-21-06-000-801\nAMM B737-600/700/800/900\n\nParagraph 3.G.1 thru 3.G.3\nInstall the Filter Element."
